四、解压和复现
先解压课程原始c16工程，再将本包按原路径放入工作副本；不要覆盖本人W02已提交目录。
本包不含.venv、.runtime、validation-project、规模数据和密钥。docs/w02的两份原件仅为引用核查附件，未修改。
恢复运行定制见artifacts/w03/runtime-customization-current/RESTORE.txt。
以下命令在准备好课程Python3.11环境与数据后、工程根目录执行：

.venv/bin/python customer/w03/restore_runtime.py --workspace .
.venv/bin/python customer/w03/restore_runtime.py --workspace . --apply
.venv/bin/python tools/w03.py load --library artifacts/w03/library --data materials/data/small --project .runtime/qinghe-submit-small-v1
.venv/bin/python customer/w03/make_tests_general32.py --data materials/data/small --project .runtime/qinghe-submit-small-v1 --output artifacts/w03/cases-submit-small-v1
.venv/bin/python tools/w03.py load --library artifacts/w03/library --data materials/data/large --project .runtime/qinghe-submit-large-v1
.venv/bin/python customer/w03/make_tests_general32.py --data materials/data/large --project .runtime/qinghe-submit-large-v1 --output artifacts/w03/cases-submit-large-v1

以上新目录需不存在；若重复执行，换版本路径。load和生成期望不调用模型。
下列测试需要自行配置模型并产生调用费用；本次打包没有执行：
.venv/bin/python tools/w03.py test --project .runtime/qinghe-submit-small-v1 --cases artifacts/w03/cases-submit-small-v1/tests-general32.json --output artifacts/w03/test-submit-small-v1 --judge-command .venv/bin/python customer/w03/judge.py
.venv/bin/python tools/w03.py test --project .runtime/qinghe-submit-large-v1 --cases artifacts/w03/cases-submit-large-v1/tests-general32.json --output artifacts/w03/test-submit-large-v1 --judge-command .venv/bin/python customer/w03/judge.py

